COMPAT_DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"is_theorem":true,"name":"RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Compat.FiniteLaw.shifted_anticoncentration_transfer","type":"∀ {Ω : Type u_1} {Γ : Type u_2} {Δ : Type u_3} [inst : Fintype Ω] [Fintype Γ] [Fintype Δ]\n  (p : RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Compat.FiniteLaw Ω) (Z : Ω → Γ) (U : Ω → Δ) (g : Γ → Δ),\n  (∀ (ω : Ω), U ω = g (Z ω)) →\n    ∀ (A : Γ → ℤ) (Y : Ω → ℕ) (H : Γ → Prop) (S : Ω → Prop),\n      (∀ (ω : Ω), S ω → H (Z ω)) →\n        ∀ (b : ℝ),\n          0 ≤ b →\n            (∀ (z : Γ),\n                (0 < p.prob fun ω => Z ω = z) →\n                  H z → ∀ (q : ℕ), (p.conditionalProb (fun ω => Z ω = z) fun ω => Y ω = q) ≤ b) →\n              ∀ (u : Δ),\n                (0 < p.prob fun ω => U ω = u) →\n                  ∀ (j : ℤ), (p.conditionalProb (fun ω => U ω = u) fun ω => A (Z ω) + ↑(Y ω) = j ∧ S ω) ≤ b"}
